0..127 Comment "/// The `nixpkgs` attribute `hello`, as `nix eval --json` prints its `meta` and `outputs`, read into a record type and a value."
128..131 Comment "///"
132..343 Comment "/// The Nix type provider reads an attribute of the local `nixpkgs` checkout into a record type the checker admits. No check-time site performs that read yet, so this source states the provider\'s answer by hand."
344..347 Comment "///"
348..700 Comment "/// `nix/hello.meta.json` and `nix/hello.outputs.json` are the reads\' JSON at `nixpkgs` revision `3ec636362e18`. The meta keeps the fields a package\'s description and its platforms need, and drops the maintainers and the positions in the checkout. It keeps the first twelve of the 79 platforms, since the printer spells a value at most 32 formers deep."
701..704 Comment "///"
705..721 Comment "/// - see: #2763"
722..738 Comment "/// - see: #2991"
739..792 Comment "/// - see: `corpus/model/package/nix/hello.meta.json`"
793..847 Comment "/// - see: `corpus/model/package/nix-derivation.gandr`"
